{
  "body": "The new primary plan is docs/plans/2026-09-12-unified-validation-implementation.md. It preserves the prior directory plan and completed directory-m1/directory-m2 identities. Five new validation-mN milestones allocate cache retirement; trusted common selected executor; broad/main composition and classification retirement; actual independent cases in the three named suites; and exact source/portable-product adoption. Every VAL requirement and retained TEST criterion maps to proof; process-tree cleanup, nested budget, discovery completeness, preflight/diagnostic scope, actual packaged products and source preservation have integrated allocation. Full original plus directory Design assessments inform the exact current model basis. Existing scripts/catalog/fixtures/caller locations were inspected directly; no project-map reliance or runtime-success claim is made. The default cache directory is present but only its type/immediate count was inspected; M1 must inspect exact content before any deletion. No cache/source/runtime implementation was performed during planning. Independent Delivery Review must assess the new exact plan; directory Delivery approval does not cover it. Final whole-change review includes earlier directory/hierarchy changes and all remaining implementation. No new mutable work is initialized from this unreviewed draft; existing directory work remains untouched.",
  "change_id": "2026-09-12-unified-validation-model",
